{"script":"sj_041_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯，确实是很棒的居住体验。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]在治安队里，为了避免战技退步，我每天睡前都会用剩余的体力做强度训练，之后才会睡去。每天醒来时让肌肉记忆着前晚的疲劳，以此来提醒我不能疏于锻炼。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但在这里休息完之后，几乎所有的疲劳都会消失，真是不可思议。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但治安队员可不能沉溺于舒适。在这种环境下，我们必须更加勤于律己。倒不如说，我不需要这种舒适的环境。{myName}，请立即把我柔软的羽毛床铺撤换下来。[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]或者，把我的伙食改得粗糙一些，或者给我分配更多的契约任务。毕竟一段时间不回大市集，养尊处优这么久，说不定会失去作为治安队员的警觉……！[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你说……没有必要？既然现在暂时离开大市集了，强迫自己疲劳可能会适得其反，偶尔也需要放松一下？[l][cm]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"text":"[show]唔……既然是你的建议……那我暂时就先忍耐一下吧。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"埃迪蒂","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara041_1_face_chara041_1a","noIn":false,"x":280,"img":"chara041_1","scaleY":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","y":-350,"mirrow":false},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"埃迪蒂-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}